<refentry xml:id="yaf-session.offsetexists" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">
 <refnamediv>
<refname>Yaf_Session::offsetExists</refname>
<refpurpose>检查会话键是否存在（ArrayAccess）</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>

 <refsect1 role="description">
  &reftitle.description;
  <methodsynopsis>
   <modifier>public</modifier> <type>bool</type><methodname>Yaf_Session::offsetExists</methodname>
   <methodparam><type>mixed</type><parameter>name</parameter></methodparam>
  </methodsynopsis>
  <simpara>检查会话键是否存在。此方法是 <methodname>Yaf_Session::has</methodname> 的别名，在以数组方式使用 <literal>isset()</literal> 时会被调用。</simpara>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1 role="parameters">
  &reftitle.parameters;
  <variablelist>
   <varlistentry>
    <term><parameter>name</parameter></term>
    <listitem>
<simpara>要检查的会话键。</simpara>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>
  </variablelist>
 </refsect1>
 <refsect1 role="returnvalues">
  &reftitle.returnvalues;
<simpara>键存在时返回 &true;，否则返回 &false;。</simpara>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1 role="examples">
  &reftitle.examples;
  <example>
   <title><methodname>Yaf_Session::offsetExists</methodname> 示例</title>
   <programlisting role="php">
<![CDATA[
<?php
$session = Yaf_Session::getInstance();
$session->start();

$session["user_id"] = 42;

var_dump(isset($session["user_id"]));
var_dump(isset($session["user_name"]));
?>
]]>
   </programlisting>
   &example.outputs.similar;
   <screen>
<![CDATA[
bool(true)
bool(false)
]]>
   </screen>
  </example>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1 role="seealso">
  &reftitle.seealso;
  <simplelist>
   <member><methodname>Yaf_Session::has</methodname></member>
   <member><methodname>Yaf_Session::offsetGet</methodname></member>
  </simplelist>
 </refsect1>
</refentry>

